flowchart TD
    A[Model response item] --> B[ToolRouter.build_tool_call]
    B --> C[Typed ToolCall]
    C --> D[ToolInvocation]
    D --> E[ToolRegistry.dispatch_any]
    E --> F[Pre-tool hook / argument rewrite]
    F --> G{Policy and approval}
    G -->|deny| X[Error result]
    G -->|allow or approved| H{Sandbox / execution boundary}
    H --> I[Unified exec]
    H --> J[Apply patch]
    H --> K[MCP or dynamic provider]
    I --> L[Runtime output]
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M[Post-tool hook and result conversion]
    M --> N[ResponseInputItem with same call_id]
    N --> O[Events and rollout persistence]
    O --> P[Normalized model context]
    P --> Q[Next model request]
    C -. cancellation .-> R[Parallel runtime gate]
    R -. abort or await cleanup .-> I
